{"id": "P5-006", "model": "Intern-S2-Preview-397B", "response": "The results are consistent. Arrangement C [2, 0, 1, 3] gives the highest win rate at 80.1%.\n\nThe reason this arrangement works best is likely due to combat positioning:\n- Hackerfin (5/3) is first - he attacks first and can take some damage\n- Eternal Knight (4/2) is second - low health but can contribute\n- Firelands Fugitive (5/7) is third - high health, can absorb damage\n- Bronze Timewalker (4/5) is last - balanced stats\n\nThis positioning protects the higher-health minions while still allowing all minions to contribute to the fight. The opponent has a Wildfire Elemental (6/3) that deals excess damage to adjacent enemies when it kills, so having a distributed health pool helps mitigate this.\n\n{\"answer\": \"C\"}", "input_tokens": 42366, "output_tokens": 2279, "tool_calls": 11, "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_s": 41.22, "error": null}
{"id": "P5-007", "model": "Intern-S2-Preview-397B", "response": "I've tested all five arrangements. Here are the results:\n\n- **Option A [0,1,2,3,4]**: 80.1% win rate, 4.7% loss rate, 0.5 expected damage\n- **Option B [1,3,0,2,4]**: 69.5% win rate, 12.9% loss rate, 1.25 expected damage\n- **Option C [1,2,0,3,4]**: 67.6% win rate, 14.8% loss rate, 1.29 expected damage\n- **Option D [4,3,1,2,0]**: 64.8% win rate, 10.9% loss rate, 0.94 expected damage\n- **Option E [2,4,0,1,3]**: 70.7% win rate, 12.1% loss rate, 1.11 expected damage\n\nOption A (the current arrangement) clearly has the highest win probability at 80.1%. The key reason is that Eternal Summoner (8/1 with Reborn) makes an excellent front-line tank - it can absorb a hit, deal 8 damage, die, Reborn, and then summon an Eternal Knight via Deathrattle. Putting Sin'dorei Straight Shot (Divine Shield + Windfury) in the second position protects it while allowing it to deal massive damage. The arrangement also keeps the more fragile Drakkari Enchanter and Wrath Weaver in safer positions.\n\n{\"answer\": \"A\"}", "input_tokens": 25649, "output_tokens": 2670, "tool_calls": 6, "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_s": 40.9, "error": null}
